/ActualText (Hey Unitians, it's Adhav, and although it's only been my second issue as Editor-in-Chief, it will also be the last time I lay my fingers on this newsletter.      Over the past four years, I have been granted the opportunity to work on these issues, and I have held them close to my heart. Having joined this newsletter in my first year in Unity to working on six issues has been a blast and, for certain, one of the most convivial experiences of my life. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
98 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Eagle's Eye is all about acting as a platform to provide a voice to our students and enlighten Unitians in any capacity. This issue, in particular, has been blessed with the insights of unprecedented student writers who have whole-heartedly written articles like the Impact of AI on the Future of Education, topics that may concern us. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
99 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
