/ActualText (We fervently hope that the ninth issue of The Eagle's Eye will be worthwhile, taking your mind off stress for a few minutes by having a fun time. With that, we hope you cultivate a passion for language arts and inspire you to enjoy writing!)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
