/T (So what can we do? I would say to be aware of these tactics, keeping in mind that there could be even more tactics we do not know of, exercising self-control on one spending. As well as to spread awareness to your friends and family. Ultimately, I suggest you support genuinely good games that are not toxic, ergo games developed to create enjoyable and memorable experiences, not games that are just hungry for your wallet.)
/E (So what can we do? I would say to be aware of these tactics, keeping in mind that there could be even more tactics we do not know of, exercising self-control on one spending. As well as to spread awareness to your friends and family. Ultimately, I suggest you support genuinely good games that are not toxic, ergo games developed to create enjoyable and memorable experiences, not games that are just hungry for your wallet.)
