185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Everybody knows nobody can stand a hypocrite. Lie to yourself or others all you want, but deep down, it's impossible not to get annoyed at one, especially when they're against you. But truth be told, every single one of us has been prone to hypocrisy against one another at some point. We're no saints.)
/Pg 15 0 R
