/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Sadly, that isn't the end. Loss of biodiversity, deforestation, food waste and plastic pollution are just a few other environmental catastrophes we are currently facing. The worries for the future and health of our planet are still very prominent in our lives and terrifying to think about. Some people stay oblivious to it, while others stay wary of every move they make to maintain an eco-friendly lifestyle. The friends in our lives who choose to worry about every eco-unfriendly action may not be making the healthiest lifestyle choice. However, they undoubtedly have an excellent reason to be concerned. As a matter of fact, the survival of planet Earth determines not only the future of mother nature but also the future of every single one of our lives. The careers we dream of having, and the families we intend to build, depend not only on whether the Earth can survive till then but also on whether we allow it to. If the Scientists are right, we only have around ten years before we fall into a climate catastrophe, so what will you do about it? )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Temperatures around the world are also escalating, enabling the atmosphere to hold and release enormous amounts of water, which will eventually affect millions of people around the globe with extreme storms, floods and droughts.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
